    {"id":"you-are-in-charge","art":"art/you-are-in-charge.webp","text":"Computers follow instructions in programs. In our game, you can give clear steps to reach a goal.","quickWords":[{"en":"instruction","th":"คำสั่ง"},{"en":"program","th":"โปรแกรม"},{"en":"goal","th":"เป้าหมาย"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/you-are-in-charge.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/you-are-in-charge.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"draw-a-house","art":"art/draw-a-house.webp","text":"Ask a friend to draw a house. Give every little step and see what they draw.","quickWords":[{"en":"step","th":"ขั้นตอน"},{"en":"draw","th":"วาด"},{"en":"friend","th":"เพื่อน"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/draw-a-house.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/draw-a-house.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"one-step","art":"art/one-step.webp","text":"Good instructions go one step at a time. First this, then that.","quickWords":[{"en":"one step at a time","th":"ทีละขั้น"},{"en":"first","th":"ก่อน"},{"en":"then","th":"แล้ว"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/one-step.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/one-step.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"order","art":"art/order.webp","text":"The order matters. You put your socks on before your shoes.","quickWords":[{"en":"order","th":"ลำดับ"},{"en":"sock","th":"ถุงเท้า"},{"en":"shoe","th":"รองเท้า"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/order.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/order.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"be-exact","art":"art/be-exact.webp","text":"Exact instructions work best. 'Three steps forward' is better than 'walk a long way.'","quickWords":[{"en":"exact instructions","th":"คำสั่งที่ชัดเจน"},{"en":"forward","th":"ไปข้างหน้า"},{"en":"step","th":"ขั้นตอน"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/be-exact.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/be-exact.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"vanilla-grid","art":"art/vanilla-grid.webp","text":"On the grid, the robot starts at A1 facing up. Move forward 3 squares, turn right, then move forward 4 squares to reach Vanilla at E4.","quickWords":[{"en":"grid","th":"ตารางช่องสี่เหลี่ยม"},{"en":"robot","th":"หุ่นยนต์"},{"en":"turn right","th":"เลี้ยวขวา"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/vanilla-grid.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/vanilla-grid.timing.json"}},
    {"id":"wrong-step","art":"art/wrong-step.webp","text":"The robot reached the slipper instead of Vanilla! Check the steps, find what went wrong, and try again.","quickWords":[{"en":"slipper","th":"รองเท้าแตะ"},{"en":"find","th":"หา"},{"en":"wrong","th":"ผิด"}],"narration":{"clip":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/wrong-step.m4a","timing":"audio/pages/exact-instructions/wrong-step.timing.json"}},
